<title>USA: Oil-Dri Corp of America Q4 July 31 net off.</title>
<headline>Oil-Dri Corp of America Q4 July 31 net off.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended July 31</p>
<p>			   1996     % of Sales     1995  % of Sales</p>
<p> Net Sales	   $36,254,367     100.0   $36,538,045  100.0</p>
<p> Cost of Sales	25,331,387	69.9    26,896,458   73.6</p>
