<p>  (Expense)	    (130,326)     (0.4)	 113,441    0.3</p>
<p>Income Before</p>
<p>  Income Taxes	 1,181,816	 3.2     1,784,211    4.9</p>
<p> Income Taxes(b)	 367,555	 1.0	 713,612    2.0</p>
