<p>a - Includes a charge of $921,000 ($0.10 a share after taxes) from cost of settlement and legal fees related to a patent litigation in the second quarter of fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>b - 1995 amount includes a charge of $263,000 ($0.04 a share after taxes) from a change in estimated amounts between financial reporting and tax reporting used to calculate fiscal year 1994 income tax expense.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
